          "prompt": "Use this image as reference to create a new variation in the exact same visual style, but replace all text and copy with the following slide content:\n\n=== [REFERENCE STYLE SPECIFICATION] ===\n• Background: Pure minimalist white studio background with soft natural floor shadow.\n• Top Navigation: Clean metadata typography with copyright stamps and bold title block.\n• Typography Hierarchy: Heavy condensed grotesque sans-serif with bold geometry and sharp letterforms.\n• Color Highlights: Pastel pink and lime highlighter blocks behind key highlighted words\n• Floating Decals: Central physical luxury hero object completely covered in graphic streetwear decals, barcodes, and skate stickers.\n• Lighting & Finish: 50mm prime macro lens, soft directional key light, authentic subsurface scattering, 35mm motion-picture film grain.\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 MISSION: SCROLL-STOPPING VISUAL HERO PIECE] ===\n• Objective: Stop the scroll instantly within 1.5 seconds with a breathtaking, high-aesthetic visual masterpiece.\n• Visual Architecture: Dominant central composition, massive bold stacked typography with vibrant highlighter bars, and playful floating 3D micro-stickers (cherries 🍒, disco ball 🪩, lightning ⚡, cash 💸, pixel mouse cursor 🖱️).\n\n=== [SLIDE 1 VARIATION CONTENT] ===\nSlide Purpose: Slide 1 of 8 (HOOK)\nCard Counter Tag: \"01 // 08\"\nTop Pill Badge: \"NANO BANANA RECIPE\" with a small pink dot\nMain Headline: \"how to make $5k luxury brand posters in 3 minutes.\" (Render in massive bold stacked editorial serif with tight leading)\nHighlighter Words: Put a soft pastel pink highlighter bar behind words: \"luxury, posters, 3 minutes\"\nSubtitle / Description: \"You do not need Photoshop or complex 3D software. Just this simple reference formula.\"\nSpeech Bubble Stickers: \"Simple Strategy\" (green), \"Nano Banana 2\" (pink)\nBottom Swipe Prompt: \"SWIPE FOR THE PROMPT →\"\n\n=== [OUTPUT SPECIFICATIONS] ===\nAspect Ratio: 4:5 vertical portrait (1080x1350) for Instagram Carousel.\nQuality: Ultra-sharp typography, perfect spelling, crisp vector edges, fine paper grain texture, zero AI blur, zero CGI sheen.",
